* SIM-C3 스위치 켬 순간 CORE_3V3·CORE_1V8 강하 — 코어 레일 = 이상 전원 + 경로 0.1 Ω + 로컬 C (코어 SCH 03 출력 10 µF ×2 X5R → 3.3 V 바이어스 12 µF, 1V8 10 µF → 8.5 µF 가정)
.model PAO PMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.9 KP=10.5 W=1 L=1 CGSO=0 CGDO=0)
.model PDM PMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.7 KP=13.37 W=1 L=1 CGSO=0 CGDO=0)
V33 s33 0 3.32
R33 s33 c33 0.1
C33 c33 0 12u
V18 s18 0 1.8
R18p s18 c18 0.1
C18p c18 0 8.5u
* 전면 CAM_EN (1 ms): Q3 → CAM_PG, Q7 → CAM_1V8_PD
Ven en 0 PULSE(0 1 1m 1u 1u 1 2)
R4 c33 pg 100k
Sq3 pg 0 en 0 SQ
R5 pg pgav 10k
Mq1 iov pg c33 c33 PAO
Cg1 pg c33 645p
Mq2 avd pgav c33 c33 PAO
Cg2 pgav c33 645p
C7 iov 0 1u
C8 avd 0 1.1u
Ri iov 0 110
Ra avd 0 110
* CAM_1V8 (C-018): R17 4.7k 풀업, Q7 → R18 1k, C19 4.7 nF 게이트–드레인
R17 c18 g6 4.7k
Sq7 pd 0 en 0 SQ
R18 pd g6 1k
C19 g6 v18 4.7n
Mq6 v18 g6 c18 c18 PDM
Cg6 g6 c18 808p
C11 v18 0 1.1u
R19 v18 0 10k
Rx1 v18 0 450
* 캐리어 SD (10 ms): Q3 → SD_PWR_GD, R22 47k / C21 100 nF
Vsd sden 0 PULSE(0 1 10m 1u 1u 1 2)
R11 c33 gd 100k
Sq3c gd 0 sden 0 SQ
R22 gd gsd 47k
C21 gsd c33 100n
Mq2c sdv gsd c33 c33 PAO
Cg2c gsd c33 645p
Csd sdv 0 11.1u
Rsd sdv 0 16.5
R23 sdv 0 100k
.model SQ SW(Ron=1 Roff=1e9 Vt=0.5)
.options method=gear
.control
set wr_singlescale
set wr_vecnames
tran 0.1u 40m
wrdata c3.dat v(c33) v(c18) v(iov) v(avd) v(v18) v(sdv)
quit
.endc
.end
